{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01037",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.79,
      "end_seconds": 7.12,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "Doctor, this one's ready for you. Everything's on the chart, but I'll go through it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.18,
      "end_seconds": 12.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.83,
      "end_seconds": 18.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, you know, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.51,
      "end_seconds": 23.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.18,
      "end_seconds": 38.87,
      "duration_seconds": 13.69,
      "text": "Uh, I'm here because of heartburn most days. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 40.52,
      "end_seconds": 45.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pressure 125 over 77, heart rate 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.89,
      "end_seconds": 49.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Thanks. Have you noticed any triggers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.6,
      "end_seconds": 55.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Yes, lying flat and large meals. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.85,
      "end_seconds": 63.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "And, And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 63.44,
      "end_seconds": 69.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.81,
      "end_seconds": 76.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "I, I was getting to that! There's food sticking sometimes as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.69,
      "end_seconds": 81.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "A few quick ones: weight loss, black stools or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.26,
      "end_seconds": 94.71,
      "duration_seconds": 12.45,
      "text": "No, no weight loss, no black stools, no vomiting. I did have a sour taste at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.17,
      "end_seconds": 99.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Did you notice any chest pain on exertion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.9,
      "end_seconds": 104.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Nope, no chest pain on exertion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.31,
      "end_seconds": 108.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.53,
      "end_seconds": 111.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.1,
      "end_seconds": 115.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.09,
      "end_seconds": 117.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.46,
      "end_seconds": 122.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "So, have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.6,
      "end_seconds": 133.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.36,
      "text": "I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.78,
      "end_seconds": 137.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.72,
      "end_seconds": 142.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.88,
      "end_seconds": 161.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.19,
      "end_seconds": 167.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.36,
      "end_seconds": 172.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.09,
      "end_seconds": 176.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "My sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.68,
      "end_seconds": 182.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.93,
      "end_seconds": 184.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "It's pantoprazole, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.48,
      "end_seconds": 187.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.32,
      "end_seconds": 193.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "It's 40 milligrams. It's lisinopril, 10 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.4,
      "end_seconds": 198.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.14,
      "end_seconds": 206.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.06,
      "end_seconds": 211.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.36,
      "end_seconds": 217.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "I have acid reflux, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.43,
      "end_seconds": 219.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.54,
      "end_seconds": 225.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "I've had gout for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.28,
      "end_seconds": 228.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.51,
      "end_seconds": 239.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Mm, I've had high blood pressure for nearly five years now. I have arthritis in my knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.32,
      "end_seconds": 242.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.65,
      "end_seconds": 245.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.63,
      "end_seconds": 266.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with mild tenderness at the top."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.73,
      "end_seconds": 273.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.65,
      "end_seconds": 317.53,
      "duration_seconds": 34.88,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it points towards reflux with a swallowing symptom that needs a camera test. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Another possibility is a narrowing of the gullet. I think an endoscopy makes sense here, for dysphagia and reflux. I'd like to arrange a blood count for reflux. Eat smaller meals and avoid eating for three hours before bed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.89,
      "end_seconds": 339.1,
      "duration_seconds": 20.21,
      "text": "I'm going to send a referral to the gastroenterology clinic. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Let's plan a check after the endoscopy. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.63,
      "end_seconds": 343.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.73,
      "end_seconds": 347.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}